            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Search</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>from:me</code> and <code>from:"&lt;your name/phone&gt;"</code> match your sent messages (AddressBook "Me" record auto-detected).</li>
                    <li><code>chat:"A, B, C"</code> matches a group with EXACTLY those participants — the unnamed-group case Messages.app renders as a comma list.</li>
                    <li><code>with:"A, B, C"</code> splits commas and AND's the participants — the loose-superset variant.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Dashboard</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Timeline slider: fixed drag-past-swap regression and now shows the year on both bounds.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Updates</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Sparkle 2.x wired in — Check for Updates… in the menu bar.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
